WEBVTT

00:13.650 --> 00:16.490
Fly high, make it

00:16.490 --> 00:19.740
Get to the new world that I seek

00:19.950 --> 00:26.330
Someday with my little wings

00:26.500 --> 00:32.550
Don't look back to the sorrow I left behind

00:32.880 --> 00:38.720
Here's my real intention I hide

00:39.260 --> 00:45.480
I wish you were here, and so just right by my side

00:45.690 --> 00:51.780
Need to be strong enough to swallow my pride

00:52.070 --> 00:57.780
I have been looking for my own style

00:57.780 --> 01:05.290
Don't give it up, here comes the life

01:08.170 --> 01:10.920
Be alive, take it

01:10.920 --> 01:14.170
Promise to find, yes I will

01:14.460 --> 01:20.640
Shining wings filled with wishes

01:20.930 --> 01:23.720
Fly high, make it

01:23.720 --> 01:27.190
Get to the new world that I seek

01:27.230 --> 01:33.690
Someday, so I believe

01:45.580 --> 01:47.710
Good afternoon, Renji-kun.

01:49.080 --> 01:52.210
Good afternoon. You took your time today.

01:52.210 --> 01:54.960
Yes. I finished writing the novel.

01:55.710 --> 01:58.970
I wrote the last part myself.

01:58.970 --> 02:01.470
I-I see.

02:01.800 --> 02:03.220
What's wrong?

02:03.640 --> 02:05.220
Congratulations on completing it.

02:05.220 --> 02:06.890
Thank you.

02:07.430 --> 02:11.150
But it's not done yet.

02:11.150 --> 02:14.400
After you finish reading it, if there isn't a problem, then it's done.

02:14.940 --> 02:18.900
This is something the two of us wrote together.

02:18.900 --> 02:21.320
Which ending did you choose?

02:22.410 --> 02:27.580
Did you end it with the girl entering the paintings, or the boy coming out of the paintings?

02:28.080 --> 02:30.710
You haven't decided on the ending yet, right?

02:30.710 --> 02:33.290
About that... You'll know when you read it.

02:33.290 --> 02:34.250
Okay.

02:35.300 --> 02:36.380
Please wait.

02:37.380 --> 02:40.550
Please read it after I've gone home.

02:40.550 --> 02:41.890
It's embarrassing.

02:42.890 --> 02:45.310
I should express my gratitude to you.

02:45.310 --> 02:46.310
Gratitude?

02:46.310 --> 02:52.150
I couldn't have finished writing the novel by myself.

02:52.150 --> 02:54.310
This is all thanks to you.

02:54.610 --> 02:56.730
I didn't do anything.

02:56.730 --> 02:59.490
You had the ability to write it to begin with.

02:59.490 --> 03:05.200
No. I don't think I could've done anything without you.

03:05.490 --> 03:11.250
You created the chance for me to fulfill my only dream.

03:12.750 --> 03:16.000
Yes, with this, I'm...

03:18.710 --> 03:20.720
Please let me express my gratitude to you.

03:20.720 --> 03:23.390
I want to express my gratitude to you.

03:23.970 --> 03:25.220
Chihiro.

03:25.220 --> 03:28.390
If there's anything I can do, please tell me.

03:28.890 --> 03:31.730
Then... will you go on a date with me?

03:31.730 --> 03:34.480
A... date?

03:34.900 --> 03:35.810
Will you?

03:36.270 --> 03:39.440
Going on a date is something lovers do.

03:39.440 --> 03:41.990
Can't we be lovers?

03:44.360 --> 03:48.490
As I thought. I won't do after all.

03:48.490 --> 03:51.540
That's not... It's not like that.

03:52.960 --> 03:56.040
Okay. Let's be lovers.

03:56.380 --> 03:58.420
But only for one day.

03:58.710 --> 04:00.000
Only for one day?

04:00.000 --> 04:05.300
Yes. You and I will be lovers only for tomorrow.

04:05.300 --> 04:07.180
So let's have a date.

04:07.600 --> 04:08.930
Only for tomorrow?

04:09.260 --> 04:11.520
It's called a trial period.

04:11.850 --> 04:13.810
Then how about starting the day after tomorrow?

04:13.810 --> 04:16.270
Let me think about it tomorrow.

04:16.560 --> 04:21.030
Can you read the novel another time?

04:21.990 --> 04:25.280
Please read it after our date tomorrow.

04:33.200 --> 04:35.750
The two of you are really similar.

04:36.210 --> 04:38.750
Who am I similar to?

04:39.090 --> 04:41.500
I wonder. I've already forgotten about her.

04:41.880 --> 04:44.550
The person you're waiting for?

04:44.550 --> 04:46.470
I forgot about her too.

04:47.050 --> 04:48.010
Erm...

04:48.010 --> 04:49.010
Hmm?

04:49.010 --> 04:52.890
What does it feel like to fall in love with someone?

04:53.270 --> 04:56.230
Let's see. You feel like there's no helping it.

04:56.230 --> 04:57.560
There's no helping...?

04:57.560 --> 05:00.110
When you finally notice, it's already too late.

05:00.110 --> 05:03.650
It's too late no matter how you feel.

05:03.650 --> 05:07.410
In that case, it might be too late for me too.

05:07.820 --> 05:08.780
I see.

05:09.120 --> 05:13.370
Erm, thank you for everything.

05:13.370 --> 05:15.410
What's the matter? You're so formal.

05:15.710 --> 05:17.370
I just felt like saying it.

05:17.370 --> 05:22.420
If I don't say it when I want to, I'll forget about it.

05:23.090 --> 05:25.510
I didn't do anything.

05:25.510 --> 05:28.180
You said the same thing as Renji-kun.

05:29.260 --> 05:31.220
We're similar too.

05:32.100 --> 05:33.890
Give this to him.

05:33.890 --> 05:35.230
What's that?

05:35.480 --> 05:37.480
Just a little custom.

05:41.730 --> 05:43.480
Good morning.

05:47.280 --> 05:48.820
M-Morning.

05:49.320 --> 05:50.910
What's wrong?

05:50.910 --> 05:52.740
Nothing... Those clothes...

05:52.740 --> 05:56.370
Since it's a date, I dressed up.

05:56.370 --> 06:01.170
Onee-chan bought it for me, even though I didn't try it on before.

06:01.500 --> 06:03.920
It's great. It's really cute.

06:04.380 --> 06:06.170
Thank you.

06:08.420 --> 06:10.970
Do you have a plan in mind?

06:10.970 --> 06:14.600
I thought about seeing a movie first.

06:14.600 --> 06:15.600
What do you think?

06:15.600 --> 06:16.980
That sounds good.

06:17.350 --> 06:19.020
What kind of movie should we see?

06:19.020 --> 06:21.600
I guess... at a time like this, a love story would be best...

06:21.600 --> 06:23.900
As long as it's not a sad one.

06:24.150 --> 06:25.570
Not a sad one?

06:25.570 --> 06:29.320
I might cry real hard.

06:29.320 --> 06:31.240
Then how about a comedy?

06:31.240 --> 06:34.240
That sounds good. I like it.

06:36.740 --> 06:43.420
Ah... Sorry. Well, I didn't think it would have a bad ending.

06:43.420 --> 06:44.880
That was totally unexpected.

06:47.920 --> 06:53.850
I'm sorry. I-I'm... going to... wash my face...

06:54.220 --> 06:55.310
Do you need a tissue?

06:55.310 --> 06:56.640
I brought some with me.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.140
Excuse me.

06:59.140 --> 07:00.100
Welcome back.

07:00.350 --> 07:03.560
It was a really good story though.

07:03.560 --> 07:06.270
It was interesting how the story took an unexpected turn.

07:06.270 --> 07:10.360
I thought it would be slapstick, but it turned out to have emotional development.

07:10.360 --> 07:11.610
Yeah.

07:11.990 --> 07:14.410
And it had a bad ending.

07:14.410 --> 07:17.290
A happy ending would've been nice.

07:17.290 --> 07:19.370
It would've... really been...

07:23.670 --> 07:25.880
I'm going to wash my face.

07:25.880 --> 07:28.840
Erm... Do you need tissues?

07:28.840 --> 07:30.380
You're mean.

07:33.590 --> 07:35.600
Where are we going next?

07:35.600 --> 07:42.730
Let's see. Since you don't like crowded places, a game center wouldn't work out...

07:48.190 --> 07:49.400
Want to give it a try?

07:49.400 --> 07:50.110
Yeah.

07:53.950 --> 07:56.450
That was a bit hard.

07:58.660 --> 08:02.620
The setup of the spring was weak, and the material was slippery.

08:04.170 --> 08:07.170
The rabbit next to it seemed to be easy though.

08:09.880 --> 08:12.720
Oh, yeah. I'll buy you a similar one next time.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.260
I know a place that sells them.

08:14.260 --> 08:16.260
Our eyes met.

08:16.760 --> 08:20.010
It said I should bring it with me.

08:22.930 --> 08:23.640
Let's go back.

08:25.350 --> 08:28.440
You want that one, right? I'll definitely get it.

08:30.780 --> 08:33.240
This time for sure. This time for sure. This time for sure.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.150
Go!

08:34.150 --> 08:35.700
Got it!

08:35.700 --> 08:37.240
Don't slip off.

08:37.240 --> 08:41.490
Keep going... Keep going... Keep going...

08:41.490 --> 08:42.660
All right!

08:43.580 --> 08:45.420
Finally got it!

08:45.420 --> 08:46.170
Here.

08:46.170 --> 08:48.420
Thank you.

08:49.130 --> 08:49.920
Poyo.

08:49.920 --> 08:50.920
Poyo?

08:50.920 --> 08:55.170
The one I have at home is Piyo-chan. This one is Poyo-chan.

08:55.470 --> 08:56.760
I-I see.

08:58.140 --> 08:59.760
Can we give that one a try too?

09:00.260 --> 09:01.260
Print Committee

09:04.430 --> 09:05.770
Please give me one piece.

09:05.770 --> 09:08.520
There are plenty of them. Let's split them half-and-half.

09:08.520 --> 09:10.400
Just one piece is enough.

09:10.400 --> 09:11.270
Really?

09:15.150 --> 09:17.110
Thank you, Renji-kun.

09:17.530 --> 09:18.450
Yeah.

09:18.990 --> 09:21.450
Today was really fun.

09:21.450 --> 09:22.540
That's good to hear.

09:23.290 --> 09:25.620
Erm, Renji-kun.

09:25.620 --> 09:26.500
What is it?

09:26.870 --> 09:29.630
Can we... hold hands?

09:30.710 --> 09:31.540
Yeah.

09:32.630 --> 09:34.670
Thank you.

09:34.670 --> 09:36.090
We're lovers, after all.

09:36.090 --> 09:37.470
You're right.

09:38.050 --> 09:43.220
Somehow I always feel at ease when I'm with you.

09:43.680 --> 09:45.520
What should we do now?

09:45.520 --> 09:48.020
Let's go to the beach if that's okay with you.

09:48.020 --> 09:49.020
The beach?

09:49.020 --> 09:51.900
It seems lovers go to the beach.

09:52.150 --> 09:53.190
Really?

09:53.190 --> 09:56.070
Yes. That's what the books say.

10:00.490 --> 10:04.620
What do lovers do after they come here?

10:06.040 --> 10:09.670
It wouldn't be bad just to remain like this, without doing anything.

10:09.670 --> 10:11.290
Yeah.

10:11.630 --> 10:15.590
We came here before too, right?

10:15.590 --> 10:16.460
Yeah.

10:16.460 --> 10:19.720
A lot of things happened, right?

10:19.720 --> 10:21.050
Yeah.

10:24.310 --> 10:26.680
A lot of things happened.

10:26.680 --> 10:30.310
I know about them because I've read my diary over and over again.

10:30.310 --> 10:32.560
But I don't remember them.

10:33.440 --> 10:36.690
I'm sure by tomorrow I'll also forget about today's...

10:37.570 --> 10:40.400
It'd be nice if tomorrow never came.

10:40.400 --> 10:43.200
You shouldn't say something like that.

10:43.200 --> 10:46.910
Couldn't tomorrow possibly be a better day than today?

10:49.790 --> 10:51.170
You're right.

10:51.170 --> 10:54.290
Oh, I totally forgot about it.

10:54.290 --> 10:58.170
Himura-san told me to give this to you.

10:59.170 --> 11:02.590
Apparently, it's a duplicate key to the school rooftop.

11:02.590 --> 11:04.430
Huh, why?

11:04.760 --> 11:09.640
The view of the streets from the rooftop in the evening is supposed to be really beautiful.

11:09.640 --> 11:13.940
That's not what I meant. Why did Himura-san have this?

11:13.940 --> 11:16.440
I wonder why.

11:16.440 --> 11:18.690
He's a really mysterious person.

11:19.280 --> 11:25.410
Apparently, it's a custom in that school to pass down this key from one person to another.

11:26.740 --> 11:28.290
Let's go and try it out.

11:28.620 --> 11:29.410
Yes.

11:36.920 --> 11:38.550
Amazing.

11:38.550 --> 11:40.800
I should thank Himura-san after this.

11:40.800 --> 11:42.380
Yeah.

11:42.760 --> 11:44.430
Amazing, amazing.

11:44.430 --> 11:47.010
Don't get too close to the edge.

11:47.010 --> 11:48.760
It's all right.

11:51.600 --> 11:53.520
It's really amazing.

11:53.520 --> 11:54.850
Yeah.

11:55.310 --> 11:56.440
Chihiro.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.270
Yes?

11:57.730 --> 11:58.770
I love you.

11:59.940 --> 12:06.240
I'll also love you tomorrow and the day after. I'll always love you.

12:07.990 --> 12:10.790
Saying something like that doesn't suit me, eh?

12:10.790 --> 12:13.370
I yearned to say it though.

12:14.790 --> 12:16.000
I love you.

12:17.250 --> 12:19.250
Can we kiss?

12:19.250 --> 12:22.090
Kissing is something lovers do.

12:22.090 --> 12:24.130
I'm your lover.

12:24.130 --> 12:28.390
In that case, you should just kiss me without saying anything.

12:28.390 --> 12:29.680
You're right.

12:29.680 --> 12:30.770
Yes.

12:34.350 --> 12:37.020
Our teeth knocked against each other.

12:38.400 --> 12:40.320
Then... let's try it one more time.

12:44.610 --> 12:48.160
S-Sorry. I got a little carried away.

12:49.950 --> 12:51.790
Please don't stop.

12:52.790 --> 12:56.500
I've finally come all the way here today.

12:56.500 --> 13:00.500
I don't want you to treat me like I'm far away.

13:00.840 --> 13:01.750
Chihiro.

13:02.340 --> 13:06.760
Please make us into a real pair of lovers.

13:13.020 --> 13:16.060
Why me?

13:16.060 --> 13:17.600
I wonder why.

13:17.600 --> 13:20.110
How about you? Why me?

13:20.110 --> 13:22.820
I wonder why. Just that...

13:22.820 --> 13:23.480
Just that?

13:23.730 --> 13:27.150
I love you too.

13:28.530 --> 13:29.490
Chihiro.

13:32.910 --> 13:33.950
What is it?

13:33.950 --> 13:35.120
I love you.

13:35.120 --> 13:36.080
Eh?

13:36.080 --> 13:37.790
I love you.

13:37.790 --> 13:39.290
I know.

13:39.290 --> 13:40.460
Renji-kun.

13:40.460 --> 13:41.170
What is it?

13:41.460 --> 13:41.920
Kiss.

13:41.920 --> 13:43.960
W-Wait a second.

13:44.800 --> 13:46.010
Can't.

13:53.560 --> 13:54.600
Geez.

13:56.430 --> 13:57.600
Is it about today?

13:57.600 --> 14:00.270
Yes, about just now.

14:00.770 --> 14:01.980
What have you written?

14:02.230 --> 14:04.480
I won't tell anyone no matter what.

14:04.730 --> 14:07.150
Tell me what you can then.

14:07.150 --> 14:09.530
Well then, our teeth knocked against each other.

14:10.610 --> 14:13.910
You were right. You can't say anything beyond that.

14:13.910 --> 14:15.370
I can't.

14:20.670 --> 14:22.170
Ten o'clock in the evening.

14:22.170 --> 14:27.970
That means the memory of our meeting at the station at nine this morning will disappear soon.

14:31.340 --> 14:37.770
From now on, an hour of Chihiro's memories about what happened today will disappear as each hour passes.

14:47.190 --> 14:48.900
They will all disappear.

14:50.990 --> 14:53.320
What's wrong, Renji-kun?

14:53.780 --> 14:56.540
Nothing. It's nothing.

14:57.290 --> 15:00.040
Yes. Everything is fine.

15:05.540 --> 15:08.130
Today has passed.

15:08.130 --> 15:08.920
Yeah.

15:08.920 --> 15:11.340
Your trial period has passed, hasn't it?

15:13.470 --> 15:14.970
You brought it with you, eh?

15:14.970 --> 15:19.100
Yes, please read it. Then it will be completed.

15:19.810 --> 15:21.060
Chihiro?

15:21.060 --> 15:24.730
I'm embarrassed after all for you to read it in front of me.

15:25.310 --> 15:29.030
I'll read this on the rooftop.

15:29.030 --> 15:33.860
I want to reread all the things that have happened from when we met up until now.

15:35.200 --> 15:38.450
Please tell me after you've finished reading it.

15:38.450 --> 15:39.450
Okay.

15:39.450 --> 15:40.660
See you later then.

15:40.660 --> 15:41.370
Okay.

15:43.370 --> 15:45.630
"The girl is the only one in the world."

15:46.040 --> 15:48.380
"That made her the god of this world."

15:49.000 --> 15:51.300
"Something mysterious happened."

15:51.300 --> 15:54.090
"The two in those paintings had moved."

15:54.470 --> 15:58.060
"The god looked inside the paintings."

15:58.890 --> 16:02.690
"The two in the pictures seemed to be having fun, smiling at each other."

16:02.690 --> 16:04.810
"But the paintings were blurred."

16:04.810 --> 16:07.020
"The world itself appeared blurred."

16:07.570 --> 16:10.990
"Why, the girl thought."

16:11.940 --> 16:15.110
"A strange feeling developed in her mind."

16:15.110 --> 16:18.530
"She could not describe what it was."

16:19.330 --> 16:23.660
"She wondered why the paintings became blurred, even though she painted them so clearly."

16:24.500 --> 16:26.880
"The two in the paintings were smiling at each other."

16:27.500 --> 16:29.710
"That was what she felt."

16:30.460 --> 16:32.550
"She repainted them."

16:32.550 --> 16:34.930
"She repainted them over and over."

16:34.930 --> 16:38.140
"But the results were exactly the same."

16:38.680 --> 16:41.180
"She was at a loss."

16:41.180 --> 16:43.850
"She began to be unsure of everything."

16:44.850 --> 16:47.100
"The girl is the only one in the world."

16:47.100 --> 16:49.480
"That made her the god of this world."

16:49.940 --> 16:54.610
"So she thought she should make her world much cleaner."

16:55.650 --> 16:58.530
"She burned all pictures."

16:59.030 --> 17:01.540
"She set fire to the mansion and the old castle."

17:02.790 --> 17:06.290
"Along with the structures, she burned all her memories."

17:07.460 --> 17:09.670
Lastly,

17:07.630 --> 17:14.300
"Lastly, the god threw the trash, the only trash left in the world, out from the cliff."

17:08.460 --> 17:09.670
the God

17:09.710 --> 17:12.550
threw the trash,

17:10.840 --> 17:12.550
the only trash left in the world —

17:12.590 --> 17:14.300
out from

17:13.300 --> 17:14.300
the cliff —

17:26.440 --> 17:27.690
Renji-kun.

17:27.690 --> 17:30.560
I finished reading the novel.

17:30.940 --> 17:32.320
How was it?

17:32.320 --> 17:35.070
Hmm, I was a bit surprised.

17:35.070 --> 17:36.610
It's a sad ending.

17:37.030 --> 17:39.450
That's not true.

17:39.450 --> 17:43.910
For the girl, it's the happiest ending.

17:44.870 --> 17:49.500
The girl shouldn't have contact with other people after all.

17:49.500 --> 17:51.920
Because she has found out what loneliness is.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.170
Chihiro...

17:53.170 --> 17:56.670
That girl is us.

17:57.550 --> 18:00.260
Renji-kun, let's break up.

18:02.180 --> 18:03.260
I don't want to.

18:03.510 --> 18:06.770
Even if you're obstinate about it, I won't give way about this.

18:07.100 --> 18:07.770
I don't want to.

18:08.140 --> 18:09.310
I'm sorry.

18:09.690 --> 18:10.850
I don't want to.

18:10.850 --> 18:13.820
Did I tell you the story of the sheep?

18:14.860 --> 18:20.110
The story about the sheep tied by a chain, that died after eating up all the grass.

18:20.110 --> 18:21.070
Yeah.

18:21.070 --> 18:25.540
I'm tied by a chain that's twelve years long.

18:25.540 --> 18:30.420
No matter how much time goes by, I can't get to the outside world from there.

18:30.420 --> 18:33.170
The farthest my hand can reach is thirteen hours from there.

18:33.920 --> 18:38.840
The story I wrote was about my dream inside those twelve years.

18:39.380 --> 18:43.930
That's why after I finished writing the story, everything of mine is done.

18:45.010 --> 18:47.060
I decided at the very beginning.

18:47.470 --> 18:51.980
I'd disappear from your sight after I finished writing this novel.

18:52.940 --> 19:01.820
I thought I'd disappear quietly without leaving behind any memories, like a mermaid princess turning into a bubble.

19:01.820 --> 19:07.660
But I'm weak. I became like Cinderella instead of a mermaid princess.

19:07.660 --> 19:13.290
That's all right. It's ridiculous to call me a prince, but...

19:13.290 --> 19:15.790
You're wrong, Renji-kun.

19:16.880 --> 19:18.960
I was happy.

19:18.960 --> 19:21.430
I was really, really happy.

19:21.430 --> 19:24.300
I love you.

19:24.510 --> 19:31.270
But, since I'm like this, I don't want you to disappear from my heart.

19:32.310 --> 19:35.520
I want to break up while I can still say, "I love you".

19:35.940 --> 19:37.070
No way...

19:37.070 --> 19:39.530
That logic doesn't make sense.

19:39.780 --> 19:44.280
You let me write the novel that I abandoned a long time ago.

19:44.660 --> 19:48.580
You let me wear a uniform and go to school.

19:48.580 --> 19:53.790
You brought me out of the station where I was marooned.

19:54.290 --> 19:59.590
Before then, I had been doing nothing but looking up at the sky.

20:00.130 --> 20:03.050
I always felt like crying.

20:03.550 --> 20:08.310
I always looked up at the sky because I felt like my tears were going to start.

20:10.220 --> 20:13.810
You hugged someone like me tightly.

20:14.400 --> 20:18.900
You suffered and cried for my sake.

20:19.400 --> 20:23.490
That's why I want you to be happy too.

20:24.030 --> 20:25.740
I don't want you to be unhappy.

20:25.740 --> 20:26.740
Chihiro...

20:27.070 --> 20:33.580
If you stay with me, I believe you'll keep suffering from painful memories.

20:34.040 --> 20:36.630
I don't want that.

20:37.710 --> 20:40.090
I'm not disappearing because I hate you.

20:40.630 --> 20:44.840
Even I have a way to prevent you from being unhappy.

20:45.430 --> 20:50.220
Even though I shouldn't be able to do anything, I've found a way.

20:50.220 --> 20:51.220
I don't want to!

20:51.520 --> 20:52.980
Please praise me.

20:52.980 --> 20:55.230
I love you.

20:55.230 --> 20:59.230
How can I praise you for something stupid like that?

20:59.230 --> 21:00.770
Please smile.

21:00.770 --> 21:01.860
I don't want to.

21:02.150 --> 21:06.110
Let's part with your usual smile.

21:06.410 --> 21:07.360
I don't want to.

21:09.120 --> 21:10.160
I'm sorry.

21:12.830 --> 21:13.870
Farewell.

21:23.880 --> 21:24.880
Chihiro!

21:26.180 --> 21:26.840
This is...

21:32.060 --> 21:33.770
This is me.

21:34.600 --> 21:38.270
The diary from the day I met you until today.

21:39.650 --> 21:43.780
With this, the "I" that knew about you has disappeared.

21:44.940 --> 21:48.570
With this, I won't remember you anymore.

21:49.070 --> 21:52.790
With this, we've really broken up.

22:23.270 --> 22:34.410
akai ame ni michibikare

22:23.270 --> 22:34.410
Guide me to the red rain

22:34.830 --> 22:46.050
tabi no tsuzuki wo egaku tame

22:34.830 --> 22:46.050
For the sake of sketching the rest of the journey

22:46.420 --> 22:57.390
todoke hate made douka kanata he

22:46.420 --> 22:57.390
Please reach the other side, even if it means the very end

22:57.930 --> 23:08.820
te to te kasanete susumu ashita he

22:57.930 --> 23:08.820
Let's go towards tomorrow hand in hand

23:09.400 --> 23:16.540
zutto futari de

23:09.400 --> 23:16.540
Two of us, forever

23:28.340 --> 23:31.260
The end of the season is a time of beginning.

23:32.340 --> 23:35.510
Next episode, ef - a tale of memories:

23:35.970 --> 23:36.640
Love.

23:37.810 --> 23:40.480
Do you have memories you don't want to forget?
